{#
    Routing data — single source for the Drupal/frontend route split.
    Keep this block identical in .platform/config.vcl.twig (production)
    and .ddev/nginx_full/nginx-site.conf.twig (local).

    Values are literal path prefixes (no regex); the templates add the
    language prefix and the ([/?]|$) boundary. Project-specific additions
    go to extra.project-scaffold.routing.* — see docs/configuration.md.
#}
